+                    <p>This was Practice Piece #4 for my <a href="/writings/?context=fiction+writing#browse-writing">Fiction Writing</a> course at <a href="/education/muhlenberg/">Muhlenberg College</a>. The exercise focused on point of view and psychic distance.</p>
