+                <section class="writing-piece-context" aria-labelledby="about-piece-title">
+                    <h2 id="about-piece-title">About This Piece</h2>
+                    <p>This was Practice Piece #3 for my <a href="/writings/?context=fiction+writing#browse-writing">Fiction Writing</a> course at <a href="/education/muhlenberg/">Muhlenberg College</a>. The exercise focused on developing characters.</p>
