+                    <h2 id="about-piece-title">About This Piece</h2>
+                    <p>This was Practice Piece #5 for my <a href="/writings/?context=fiction+writing#browse-writing">Fiction Writing</a> course at <a href="/education/muhlenberg/">Muhlenberg College</a>. The exercise focused on openings and pattern-making.</p>
